19. Exception Management

Security hardening exceptions are permitted only when there is a documented technical or business requirement.

Each exception must include:

Field	Requirement
System	EC2 instance/application
Control	Security control being bypassed
Reason	Documented business/technical reason
Risk	Impact of the deviation
Compensating Control	Alternative security protection
Owner	Accountable technical owner
Approval	Security/platform approval
Expiration	Required review/expiry date

Exceptions must not become permanent undocumented configuration.

